  "bodyHash": "a39a4a032af0040b",
  "content": "<p>將 HUD 食物/飢餓圖標恢復為預設的原版圖標，前提是該資源包位於其他資源包之上。當使用其他可能使這些圖標看起來更差的資源包時，此功能非常有用。</p>\n<p>現在兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Appleskin</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423741/description_88918819-52a7-4a15-85e0-901bfaf8cba6.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我製作這個主要是為了還原來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unique Dark</a> 的食物/飢餓紋理：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423741/description_fb6367d2-0e1b-43bd-a232-f6df8c8f96fa.png\" width=\"549\" height=\"73\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https:/curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-hearts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423741/description_513ca6b2-58fb-4dad-b71b-401359716cea.gif\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><br><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡或上面的圖片查看生命/紅心版本</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>你可能也會需要：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_046f7197-b381-44ca-bc3a-d0da10fd3695.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2c9cb330-cfc0-4c34-9a5c-bf7745f617de.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8d19c886-7699-4f2a-bdf8-eaebcd8d2dbd.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">舊版水流</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">舊版基岩</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">新版基岩</a><br><br></span><br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355031/description_d95d6082-b094-4c9d-82ee-b3bb4ef67702.png\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355031/description_cf1d428e-b393-4de1-80c2-cf3459479226.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354464/description_29b2415a-fdfa-44d9-ab13-1460a2fe0fa3.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354464/description_19500206-d034-4eef-9698-16a7c87cacba.png\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">靜音活塞</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">較安靜的活塞</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">靜音發射器和投擲器</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">較安靜的發射器和投擲器</a></span></strong></p>",
